index 5396a3d..7249a2a 100644
--- a/apps/zcode-cli/docs/automatic-model-selection.md
+++ b/apps/zcode-cli/docs/automatic-model-selection.md
@@ -73,3 +73,15 @@ reasons abstain while retaining observed billing facts, including server-tool-on
 Choice distributions retain only documented four-decimal rounding tolerance, matching the installed
 classifier rule `max(0.001, labelCount * 0.00005)`. Choice/score confidence must be a reported finite
 value in [0,1]; missing or invalid values fail instead of borrowing the selected probability or zero.
+
+## Shared Host operation
+
+`core/src/runtime/decision-operation.ts` owns the common prepared operation: existing storage
+preflight, unchanged operation IDs and `:intent`/`:result` artifact keys, durable unknown claim,
+admitted dispatch, one frozen usage record, pending Session usage recovery and result receipt.
+Preparation remains with each caller so Decide binds before its existing approval and automatic
+routing retains its original total deadline. No migration, new store or permission path is added.
+Decide keeps explicit approval and returns receipt/accounting state; automatic policy keeps the
+offered model on duplicate or accounting failure. `usageRecoveryPending` means a recovery instruction
+was saved at receipt time, not that cold reconciliation has completed. Missing result acknowledgement
+never proves inference did not run. Both consumers expose/retain the declared observed usage fields.
